5/5/2025 workflow:
    1) Open Melody's GSheet and copy/paste entire contents into Excel. 
        a) https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Wnz4zIbEXtUZUYQLiCw4H3M0yul581o0XxGtDisgKnc/edit?gid=1407101405#gid=1407101405
    2) File - Options - Advanced - Editing Options
        a) Uncheck Use system separators
        b) Decimal separator: ,
        c) Thousands separator: .
    3) Save as csv
    4) Open Github for Desktop
    5) Open the repository in your external editor (VS Code)
    6) Copy into project folder, rename to xrayprotocols.csv
    7) CTRL-H to Search/Replace "" with ", "< with <, >" with >
    8) make sure links are of the format:
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ct0uUm0ITY8K8QbNurzj9EJZjbHZZOEPBQcdCDYoG1s/export?format=pdf&amp;attachment=false" target="_blank">PDF</a>
    7) Save/Commit the files
    8) Sync Changes so they are available on the internet and not just my local PC
        a) check status of publication to gh-pages here: https://github.com/patrickdo/xrayprotocols
        b) https://patrickdo.github.io/xrayprotocols